---
layout: base.njk
---
<article class="article">
  <header class="art-head">
    <a class="masthead" href="/essays/">Essays</a>
    {% if kicker %}<p class="kicker">{{ kicker }}</p>{% endif %}
    <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
    {% if dek %}<p class="dek">{{ dek }}</p>{% endif %}
    {% set notes = (content.split('<li id="fn') | length) - 1 %}
    <p class="byline"><span class="by-item">By {{ author if author else 'Varna Sri Raman' }}</span>{% if page.date %}<span class="by-sep"> &middot; </span><span class="by-item"><time datetime="{{ page.date | isoDate }}">{{ page.date | readableDate }}</time></span>{% endif %}{% if readtime %}<span class="by-sep"> &middot; </span><span class="by-item">{{ readtime }}</span>{% endif %}{% if notes > 0 %}<span class="by-item by-notes"><a href="#fn1">{{ notes }} notes and sources</a></span>{% endif %}</p>
  </header>

  <div class="art-body">
    {{ content | safe }}
  </div>

  <footer class="art-foot">
    <p class="art-bio"><b>{{ author if author else 'Varna Sri Raman' }}</b> is a development economist and the author of <a href="/"><em>The Measurement Trap: India&rsquo;s Quest for Social Progress Through Eight Decades</em></a> (Routledge, March 2027).</p>
    <p class="art-contact">Need help setting out your story, what sets your work apart, the context, the return on investment and the projections? Pinpoint Ventures can help. Write to <a href="mailto:hello@pinpointventures.in?subject=Enquiry%20from%20whatcounts.in">hello@pinpointventures.in</a> or message on <a href="https://wa.me/919871777110?text=Hi%20Pinpoint%20Ventures%2C%20I%20found%20you%20through%20whatcounts.in.%20I%27d%20like%20to%20discuss%20a%20research%20or%20advisory%20engagement." target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp</a>.</p>
    <p class="art-nav"><a href="/essays/">&larr; More essays</a> &middot; <a href="/">The Measurement Trap</a></p>
  </footer>
</article>
